  tumble: {"name":"Tumble","img":"icons/svg/wingfoot.svg","frequency":"atwill","traits":["appeal","instinct","move"],"targets":"","vs":"","distance":"self","requirements":"Your Speed is at least 4.","description":"<p>You can move through enemies' spaces (never ending in one). An enemy's space you pass this way costs 1 square. Before you move, make an Appeal or Instinct Check against the same Attribute's DC of the creatures whose spaces your path crosses (the highest), with 1 Bane for each creature beyond the first: on a Tier 1 you stop in the last square before the first enemy's space and your movement ends; on a Tier 2 or 3 you pass. Passing diagonally between two enemies corner to corner counts as crossing one creature: the higher of their DCs, no Bane for the second.</p>","lines":[{"label":"Special","text":"You can move through enemies' spaces (never ending in one). An enemy's space you pass this way costs 1 square. Before you move, make an @Check[appeal|dc:targets]{Appeal Check} or @Check[instinct|dc:targets]{Instinct Check} against the same Attribute's DC of the creatures whose spaces your path crosses (the highest), with 1 Bane for each creature beyond the first: on a Tier 1 you stop in the last square before the first enemy's space and your movement ends; on a Tier 2 or 3 you pass. Passing diagonally between two enemies corner to corner counts as crossing one creature: the higher of their DCs, no Bane for the second."}],"flavor":"You duck, roll and slip past them.","versions":[{"ap":1,"noTiers":true,"t1":[],"t2":[],"t3":[],"x1":"","x2":"","x3":"","effects":"@Move[advance|distance:floor(speed/2)|pass:enemies]","fx":{"all":[],"t1":[],"t2":[],"t3":[]}},{"ap":2,"noTiers":true,"t1":[],"t2":[],"t3":[],"x1":"","x2":"","x3":"","effects":"@Move[evade|distance:2|pass:enemies]","fx":{"all":[],"t1":[],"t2":[],"t3":[]}}],"automation":"silver"},
